      "questionName": "culture, historical place, domestic tourism, reference",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the words given. You can only use the words once. You may need to change the form of the words.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 97.8979%; height: 61px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 17.7778px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25.0365%; height: 17.7778px; text-align: center;\"><strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"350\">culture</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0365%; height: 17.7778px; text-align: center;\"><strong data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"409\">historical place</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0365%; height: 17.7778px; text-align: center;\"><strong>domestic tourism</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0365%; height: 17.7778px; text-align: center;\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"549\">reference</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"149\"><br>Minh: Hey, Lan! Have you ever thought about traveling more in Vietnam instead of going abroad?</p>\n<p data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"283\">Lan: Yes! I think <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.1</label><input id='fbo-911771-0' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='0' name='fbo-911771-0' type='text' size='20' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911771-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;should be supported more. Vietnam has so many amazing places to visit.</p>\n<p data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"494\">Minh: Exactly! We have beautiful landscapes, rich <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.2</label><input id='fbo-911771-1' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='1' name='fbo-911771-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911771-1' /></span></strong>, and incredible food. Plus, visiting <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.3</label><input id='fbo-911771-2' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='2' name='fbo-911771-2' type='text' size='19' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911771-2' /></span></strong>&nbsp;like Hue Imperial City or My Son Sanctuary helps us understand our history better.</p>\n<p data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"673\">Lan: That&#8217;s true! I recently read a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.4</label><input id='fbo-911771-3' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='3' name='fbo-911771-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911771-3' /></span></strong>&nbsp;about traditional festivals in different regions. It made me realize how much there is to discover right here in Vietnam.</p>\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"813\">Minh: That sounds interesting!</p>",
